  "id": "USN-8902-1",
  "summary": "libarchive vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that libarchive had a signed integer overflow in its\nZIP writer when handling encrypted entries with sizes near the maximum\nvalue. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause libarchive to\ncrash or execute arbitrary code.",
